# ACC Schema & Forms

## Naming (must match)

| Item | Rule | Example |
|------|------|---------|
| namespace | `woo` | |
| schema name | camel `testWoo*` | `testWooAiFragment` |
| sqltable | **same as schema name** | `sqltable="testWooAiFragment"` |
| input form name | **same as schema name** | `testWooAiFragment` |
| entity-schema | `woo:` + name | `woo:testWooAiFragment` |

## Fragment schema fields (current)

Use `sql_text` (full SELECT), `plan_json` in history — **not** PRD's old `expr`/`ir_json`/`target_table`.

Required: `name`, `label`, `category`, `tags`, `key_column`, `sql_text`, `params`, `param_domain`, `description`, `sample_questions`, `status`.

## Form XML

- `<input>` uses **xpath only** — no `height`, no `type="text"` (XML-110013)
- memo fields: rely on schema `type="memo"` for multiline

## Do not deploy (DEFERRED)

`testWooAiCodemap`, `testWooAiRequestQueue` — files exist locally for future use only.

